HST Office: Slide Properties in Slides shows a size and an orientation like PowerPoint's Slide Size. Margins and
the paper tray, which are print settings, leave the view of the shared page; their values are not changed.
Draw, Writer and Sheets keep them.

License: these upstream files remain under their original license (MPL-2.0).
Test: tests/runtime/check-dialogs-writer.py slide-properties
---
--- a/cui/source/inc/page.hxx
+++ b/cui/source/inc/page.hxx
@@ -183,6 +183,7 @@
     virtual void        Reset( const SfxItemSet* rSet ) override;
     virtual void        FillUserData() override;
 
+    void                HstHideSlidePrintFields();
     void                SetPaperFormatRanges( Paper eStart )
                             { ePaperStart = eStart; }
 
